{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Cooking Club</strong> is an episodic romantic comedy, slice-of-life visual novel about cooking, friendship, and finding love where you least expect it!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High school can be boring\u2014especially when you\u2019re stuck in classes you hate. Looking for an escape, you stumble into the only club with an open spot: <strong>The Cooking Club.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as an excuse to skip class quickly turns into a whirlwind of sizzling dishes, new friendships, and unexpected sparks of romance. Between chopping veggies and stirring sauces, your ordinary school life becomes anything but ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cooking Club</strong> serves up a fun, choice-driven adventure filled with cute girls, delicious food, and plenty of laughs!<br><br><strong><u>NOTE:</u></strong>\u00a0<i>The Cooking Club</i> is an actively developed visual novel being released in an episodic format. The story is planned to expand over multiple chapters, with new content and general quality-of-life improvements released on a bi-monthly basis as development continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All future story chapters will be provided as <strong>free updates</strong> at no additional cost to players who own the game. This episodic approach allows us to continuously refine the experience, respond to player feedback, and ensure each chapter meets the quality and care we want the final release to represent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romantic comedy slice-of-life story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-driven narrative with multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun cooking mini-games to test your skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovable characters with unique personalities and routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous art, expressive sprites, and full voice acting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET THE GIRLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540590/extras/f9ea5786ad22cef927106415b17354a7.avif?t=1771946841\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540590/extras_big/f9ea5786ad22cef927106415b17354a7.webp?t=1771946841 width=1560 height=1102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540590/extras/84b64a3cdd355156d63165404b6e3de9.avif?t=1771946841\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540590/extras_big/84b64a3cdd355156d63165404b6e3de9.webp?t=1771946841 width=1560 height=1102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540590/extras/729a2764d4823a5f6d35616a39b9b53c.avif?t=1771946841\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540590/extras_big/729a2764d4823a5f6d35616a39b9b53c.webp?t=1771946841 width=1560 height=1102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540590/extras/96ee3f5163a2e0ca74597220992edb51.avif?t=1771946841\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540590/extras_big/96ee3f5163a2e0ca74597220992edb51.webp?t=1771946841 width=1560 height=1102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So\u2014are you ready to join The Cooking Club and cook up the recipe for love?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Built in the Ren\u2019Py engi